chapter.v:
You shall 


set in, 


it four rows of stones. A row of sardius,(2) topaz, and carbuncle shall be the first row;

and the 


second row, 


an emerald, a sapphire, and a diamond;

and the 


third row, 


a jacinth, an agate, and an amethyst;

You shall 


make for, 


them linen undergarments to cover their naked flesh. They shall reach from the hips to the thighs;
